<NPCCharacters>
	<!--
		Upgrade trees:
		Mounted Pillager (vanilla T2 bandit HA) [VR: Bandit -> Soldier]
		  -> Mounted Huntsman (T4 Empire HA)
		    -> Mounted Packmaster (T5 Empire HA) [war_horse + gold]
		Mounted Ransacker (vanilla T3 bandit cavalry) [VR: Bandit -> Soldier]
		  -> Imperial Bandit Horseman (T4 Empire cavalry; Bandit Javelin x4)
		    -> Imperial Elite Bandit Horseman (T5 Empire cavalry; Bandit Javelin x8) [war_horse + gold]
		Horse Bandit Chief (T4 Bandit) -> Horse Bandit Boss (T5 Bandit) [war_horse + gold; both Bandit so no Veteran's Respect]
		Highwayman (vanilla mountain_bandits_chief) [VR: Bandit -> Soldier]
		  -> Vlandian Brigand Champion (L26; Champion copy + Large Bag Simple Javelins x8)
		    -> Vlandian Brigand Banner Knight (L31; Banner Knight copy + same javelins)
		Pillager/Ransacker/Highwayman -> Soldier upgrades need Veteran's Respect; T4->T5 Soldier needs war_horse + gold.
	-->

